    "caveats": [
      "viewportToReady measures first DOM visual intersection. For cooling/fire the baseline visual mounts after deferred JS, while current visual exists initially; do not compare that boundary as a performance regression. Both raw values are retained.",
      "For the floor, the stage remains in view during transition: summary viewportToReady starts at the user view-switch action; original raw files also retain the earlier facade intersection.",
      "prepareProxy is responseEnd→ready: decode, geometry/material preparation, renderer and DOM scheduling combined. It is not isolated geometry CPU time.",
      "Facade interaction is the building-block click→floor-ready transition including camera motion/network; other interactions are selection→description heading visible with ancestor opacity >=0.5.",
      "JS heap snapshots are not GPU memory or peak memory. The independent GC diagnostic runs after all loading metrics and does not alter their timing windows.",
      "Original baseline mobile product accessible name was missing. The repeated baseline designers measurement clicks the same button by DOM text. The a11y defect was fixed independently in current."
